<title>USA: Aydin reorganizing into two operating units.</title>
<headline>Aydin reorganizing into two operating units.</headline>
<dateline>HORSHAM, Pa. 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aydin Corp said Monday it is undertaking a major reorganization that will create two decentralized operating divisions and a small corporate staff.</p>
<p>The Products Division will handle marketing, sales, design, development, manufacturing and support of all of Aydin's products. The Systems Division will handle large turnkey global systems, the company said.</p>
</text>
